dotnet11 (11.0.100-11.0.0~rc1-0ubuntu1) stonking; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Sync d/t/regular-tests with canonical/dotnet-regular-tests to fix
    autopkgtest failures on dotnet11.
    - picks up new upstream tests and drops the removed lttng test.
  * d/p/0009-fix-cecil-writecompressedint32-big-endian.patch: fix the IL
    Trimmer failing on s390x (big-endian): WriteCompressedInt32 wrote
    byte-swapped compressed ints into the PDBs.
  * d/p/0010-fix-cli-forwarding-paths-nativeaot.patch: fix "dotnet format"
    failing with "The application to execute does not exist" under the new
    Native AOT CLI, which resolved SDK-relative paths from the install root
    instead of the versioned SDK directory. Also covers the same defect in
    "dotnet nuget", "dotnet vstest" and "dotnet fsi".
  * d/t/control: add the missing distro-info test dependency, without which
    the dotnet-sdk-check-url-verification autopkgtest fails.

 -- Nicolas Rincon <nicolas.ballesteros@canonical.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 10:51:08 -0500

